evidence = "services/human/crates/layerx-human-service/src/server/production_components.rs:3276 rejects protocols other than 3 and :3308 propagates that rejection without attestors, but :3354 still expects Ok(2), an assertion retained by commit 3181f65bfba1b7585029b04348cc173ce2fbdeb7 despite its selector migration."
